# Working notes, not site content. These live in the repo but must never be
# served: Vercel publishes every file in the root as a static asset, so
# CLAUDE.md was reachable at https://tomdegay.com/CLAUDE.md -- exposing the
# repo URL, the dated session history and local filesystem paths.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Scratch pages used to eyeball a component in isolation. They are untracked,
# so a git deploy never sees them -- but `vercel --prod` ships the working
# directory, which would publish them at /card-animation-proof, /icon-proof
# and /case-studies/schema-flow-proof. No leading slash, so this matches at
# any depth, including the one under case-studies/.
*-proof.html
prototypes/image-insight/README.md
